Hi,

I'd again like to thank Mads Martin Joergensen for this software -
anything that allows me the ease of ezmlm without having to run qmail is
a huge contribution to society in general :-)

I've gone over the listtexts (English language) and corrected some
spelling / grammatical errors and made the occasional minor
clarification. I've attached a patch containing the changes if anyone
else wishes to use it.

I've also been maintaining mlmmj packages (with the abovementioned
patch) for Fedora Core 3 (and will support FC4 when it's released) over
at my apt/yum repository (see my .sig)

I'm running my small announcement list using it, so I can guarantee it
works as expected with little if any tweaking. If it breaks for you
however, let me know and I'll investigate.

Cheers,
Michael.

